title: d Interaction Design Pattern
syntax: xwiki/2.1
%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Interaction Design Patterns: reusable solutions for how the System communicates and is controlled. Kinnect introduces consenting residents on shared ground, steps back, protects private refusal and transfers sensitive questions to a trusted person. The morning-care pattern is listed separately.

**Report Format:** §2.5 Interaction Design Patterns (Interaction Level)

